1	0	Investor Profile (page 2)	The Investor Profile is defined in four stages. (1) Financial situation gives a holistic view of risk ability, i.e. the capacity to take financial risk without putting the current lifestyle or future plans at risk. (2) Investment objectives show financial goals, sustainability preference and how much risk the client is willing to take to achieve the target return, i.e. risk tolerance. (3) The assessment compares risk tolerance with risk ability so recommended products meet the objectives and the ability to bear losses.	[0.0297141,0.0723803,-0.175274,0.0304212,0.0627867,0.0105687,0.0562936,-0.0091228,0.0250781,0.0273135,-0.00315668,-0.0205677,0.0376241,0.00558246,0.0350441,-0.055039,0.0299012,-0.0857844,0.041777,0.0487024,-0.0770147,-0.0417006,-0.0483161,0.0461772,0.0106598,0.0361217,-0.0373225,-0.0446706,-0.0279107,0.0166317,0.019542,0.0221366,0.0393525,-0.024858,-0.0307484,-0.0599305,0.0502021,0.0846721,0.0121918,-0.0678545,-0.0306093,0.0128309,0.0201147,-0.0313279,0.0368642,0.0382405,0.064588,-0.0283186,0.0477079,-0.0234547,0.0378939,0.0076329,0.0206502,-0.00606664,0.101692,0.00917952,-0.0242292,0.0642815,0.011634,-0.048038,0.0443125,0.0399955,-0.0226714,0.0537645,0.0575293,-0.0321944,-0.0342098,0.0235475,0.00325199,-0.0502032,0.0495527,0.0268058,-0.0245864,-0.00148319,-0.0145652,0.0102688,-0.0116121,-0.0141588,0.010982,0.0267311,0.0307259,0.0110467,0.0601423,0.0202373,0.0379443,0.0268595,-0.0186434,-0.00647447,0.00817012,0.0561789,-0.02245,0.0560102,0.0324875,0.0496741,-0.0930135,0.0368221,-0.0644163,0.0230149,-0.0326695,-0.00742363,-0.0133184,-0.0386726,0.042328,0.00684581,0.00509435,0.0258025,-0.0106532,0.0158241,0.0292025,-0.0088953,-0.041862,0.0519074,-0.0364583,-0.019978,-0.0317951,0.0236471,0.078737,0.0329031,-0.0127921,0.0636827,-0.0201369,0.0208419,0.0565738,0.0691021,0.00267023,0.0492703,-0.0180274,-0.0232708,0.0224235,-0.00139422,0.0214525,0.00432461,-0.0201153,-0.0461621,0.00405629,0.0869156,-0.0139381,-0.0181504,-0.006349