4	3	Investment objectives (page 4)	The purpose of the investments (reserves for retirement, a planned larger expenditure, growing or preserving wealth) influences risk tolerance and strategy. With several goals it can be sensible to set up different portfolios, each with its own horizon. Investment horizon is the period the client wants to stay invested. Under identical conditions a longer horizon allows riskier investments (larger fluctuations, longer recovery); a shorter horizon calls for low-risk investments.	[0.0539758,0.0822366,-0.170429,0.00817624,0.0318056,0.043189,0.0880951,-0.0484665,0.0468932,0.0206899,-0.00568677,-0.0015362,0.0599788,0.0224099,0.0577958,-0.013939,-0.00860338,-0.0407067,0.0340838,0.0359218,-0.0307418,-0.0625754,-0.0306157,0.0203093,-0.0108447,0.0270547,-0.0180674,-0.0170671,0.0241066,0.0163118,0.0447861,0.0275606,0.00420677,-0.0234041,-0.00656729,-0.0792495,0.0342267,0.0576885,0.0349702,-0.0621115,-0.00892369,-0.00023927,0.0489398,-0.0367326,0.0635826,0.0368259,0.0684499,-0.0314582,0.0694718,-0.0397537,0.0356735,-0.0069644,-0.00368918,-0.00300124,0.0780151,0.00871727,-0.0176018,0.0393737,0.000594107,-0.0364812,0.0820697,0.0224949,0.000951956,0.0429089,0.0278431,-0.0331459,-0.0591609,-0.0134738,0.00707462,-0.0284245,0.0339691,0.012098,-0.0168318,-0.00199746,-0.0144963,0.0620364,0.00436683,-0.00513007,0.0103515,0.00725621,0.0144723,-0.0388294,0.0324876,-0.00750281,0.0342892,0.0705023,0.0166926,-0.00961939,-0.0364644,0.07537,0.00190843,0.0164931,0.0810536,0.0675925,-0.112449,0.0558046,-0.0557641,0.030278,-0.0181618,0.041495,-0.0413739,-0.00663565,0.0453564,-0.000683549,0.00971989,0.0299914,-0.00343348,-0.00556925,0.0171767,-0.0130002,-0.0239691,0.031273,-0.0509276,-0.0218997,-0.0211927,0.0198447,0.0849156,0.0219428,0.0298294,0.053029,-0.0163975,-0.0035416,0.0647902,0.0116086,-0.00770154,0.0551432,-0.0377341,-0.00881189,0.0535248,0.0101704,0.0205895,0.00697626,-0.0306161,-0.0203476,0.00241198,0.0868055,-0.0214741,-0.0381491,0.0180651,0.0788915