16	note_1013	jfr	3	Isabel: How would you describe the way you like to invest? Jane: Very conservatively. I have been investing mainly in deposits and bonds for years and I am not familiar with complex products. I prefer cash, government bonds and high-grade bonds, and I like to hold things for a long time rather than trade. I would like to own a small amount of blue-chip equities, up to about 10% of my assets.	[0.0148451,0.0787825,-0.157757,0.00184149,0.0205338,0.0349895,0.0462066,-0.053278,0.0643502,-0.00626717,-0.0200706,0.00496048,0.0316984,0.0280399,0.0420463,0.00196788,0.00127466,-0.0690692,0.0834261,0.0875067,-0.0798665,-0.046409,-0.0258864,0.00881982,0.0302347,0.0100198,-0.0373293,-0.0231354,0.00223079,0.0284596,0.0236257,-0.0385983,0.0213701,-0.0241027,-0.00399654,-0.0556898,0.00376007,0.0738685,0.0352369,-0.0449971,0.0322541,0.0274204,0.0330056,-0.0818138,0.0608056,0.0113493,0.072939,-0.0451826,0.0814393,-0.020505,0.0300434,-0.020098,0.00875169,-0.0134219,0.0708289,-0.00210174,-0.0232744,0.0557679,0.0195226,-0.0307801,0.0856017,-0.00781764,-0.0006907,0.066632,0.0212572,-0.00421942,-0.0554333,0.0283768,0.00906841,-0.0397419,0.0462834,0.0026177,0.0328252,0.0110212,-0.0448446,0.031606,-0.0123333,-0.018323,0.0395808,0.0102897,0.0368268,-0.0238277,0.0564207,-0.00849344,0.01871,0.0428487,0.0433019,-0.0068706,0.0386004,0.0746429,0.00115525,0.00299068,0.0575614,0.0839418,-0.0626173,-0.00786518,-0.0500814,0.0256582,-0.0337895,-0.025845,-0.0231412,-0.0378507,0.0122,0.0389885,0.0311992,0.0492165,0.00663865,-0.0211682,-0.0108489,-0.0133476,-0.044126,0.0345515,-0.0162909,-0.024319,-0.0441247,0.0323659,0.0135862,-0.0295164,0.0192224,0.0829842,-0.0178429,0.00948953,0.0932567,0.0206453,0.0174522,0.046305,-0.0254872,0.0234974,0.0134642,-0.00554114,-0.00133335,-0.0160112,0.0159743,-0.0344013,-0.00667093,0.0810752,-0.0183435,-0.0279196,-0.00850625,0.0407145,0.0507293,0.0118896,0.00282731,-0.0431446,-0.0609615,-0.051782,0.0222093,0.0169969,-0.0143696,0.0278303,-0.0217308,0.034