19	note_1013	jfr	6	Isabel: What do you want the portfolio to achieve? Jane: Keeping my capital safe comes first and steady income is second. After that I would like my assets to grow, but only modestly and without an aggressive approach. I want low risk, but steady growth. My target is for the portfolio to reach 700M within 8 years.	[0.0505362,0.0466683,-0.174039,0.0084661,-0.00183143,0.0273297,0.0799429,-0.0543285,0.0657819,-0.00187963,-0.0401557,0.016085,0.0595306,-0.00769652,0.0477096,0.0171268,0.00362148,-0.097146,0.057034,0.0441254,-0.0610497,-0.0571609,-0.0384968,0.0104462,0.0213384,0.0512315,-0.0156953,-0.012031,0.000831057,0.0284326,0.0265792,0.00429561,-0.0121689,-0.024831,0.00036607,-0.0668323,0.0278522,0.0588039,0.017657,-0.094073,0.036744,-0.0100997,0.0373175,-0.0563689,0.0511556,0.00171851,0.0652819,-0.0389272,0.0856892,-0.0277214,0.042274,0.0207086,0.00733847,0.0219648,0.0770751,0.0188894,-0.0321504,0.0212167,0.00687393,-0.0575756,0.101938,0.00514875,-0.0233416,0.0531866,0.0291804,-0.0488416,-0.0544614,-0.0052627,-0.0213605,-0.0270712,0.00549345,-0.0200991,-0.00589167,0.0038305,-0.0516907,0.00988724,0.000759519,-0.0124363,0.0358904,0.0115969,0.0321892,0.00428874,0.0439555,-0.0169423,0.0160203,0.0310868,0.0130246,-0.0143298,0.00753347,0.0689622,0.0198546,0.0380339,0.0324117,0.0569184,-0.061276,0.0313785,-0.0448456,0.0427458,-0.0203659,-0.0290812,-0.0198568,-0.0375851,0.0431004,0.0167629,0.0114188,0.0258449,0.0255444,-0.00823979,0.00121065,-0.013856,-0.0305996,0.00858353,-0.0299226,-0.0447508,-0.0558256,-0.0132254,0.0727552,0.00479334,0.0384526,0.0739527,-0.0280859,0.0105882,0.0723129,0.0258393,0.0118493,0.0362503,-0.0347538,0.0248282,0.0228577,-0.00684725,0.0182078,0.0113782,-0.0261556,0.017879,0.0206728,0.0964635,-0.0301316,-0.0263975,-0.0039422,0.0517896,0.0616576,0.020703,0.0288024,-0.054,-0.0668839,-0.0517655,0.0515379,0.024093,-0.00563657,0.0374809,-0.0202571,0.0280391,-0.0278103,0.0139549,0.0320777,-0.0533339,0.000790732,-0.0176908,0.0447621,-0.01