20	note_1013	jfr	7	I would not need to touch most of the capital for at least ten years, so I am a long-term investor. Isabel: From S$500m to 700M is about 40% in total, or roughly 4.3% a year if it compounds. I will test that against what a low-risk mix can deliver. Jane: That is fine. It is a target and not a promise, and I would rather miss it than take on a lot more risk.	[0.0670466,0.0714423,-0.191155,0.00187826,-0.0175701,0.00169924,0.0324272,-0.0207823,0.0914614,-0.0010361,-0.0317167,0.0106503,0.0284293,-0.0347614,0.0246543,-0.00302997,-0.00775875,-0.0745774,0.0684617,0.0745963,-0.047228,-0.070066,-0.0426666,-0.0272824,0.0103514,0.021836,-0.0243431,-0.0118422,-0.00252656,0.0326826,0.03535,-0.032326,0.00665049,-0.0512629,-0.0443497,-0.0612053,0.0340728,0.0408549,0.02164,-0.0701303,0.0532533,0.00842114,0.0487572,-0.0287892,0.0601587,0.0159452,0.0359259,-0.002336,0.0987874,-0.00765671,0.0119316,0.0210068,-0.0314333,0.0367903,0.0618275,0.0294246,-0.0743235,0.0231295,-0.00620601,-0.0421114,0.0910609,-0.0082021,-0.0212762,0.0415156,0.0418158,-0.035072,-0.0605014,0.00152048,0.00398459,-0.0168726,0.0203065,0.000848707,-0.0136034,0.0110719,-0.0632411,0.00478516,-0.0312412,-0.0081945,0.0250655,0.0237764,0.0545663,-0.0258343,0.0476653,-0.0179853,0.0607336,0.0356962,0.0181126,-0.0205544,0.000484755,0.0838757,0.0310919,0.0525753,0.0471579,0.058226,-0.0478675,0.0150567,-0.057409,0.0261256,-0.00794076,-0.00390229,-0.0401752,-0.0159357,0.0214877,0.0252775,-0.0118426,0.0372773,-0.00620185,-0.0459026,-0.000329122,-0.00454751,-0.0643098,-0.00274611,-0.0478327,-0.0507595,-0.0370557,-0.0121641,0.0364818,-0.0250311,0.000915536,0.0542556,-0.0112866,0.00728983,0.0766037,0.0390542,0.00884719,0.0297504,-0.0229425,0.0376822,0.0303578,-0.0273908,-0.00725754,-0.0044136,-0.0301119,-0.0208183,0.0265315,0.0869002,-0.0268176,-0.0276561,-0.0262779,0.0618177,0.0520195,0.0282955,0.0429279,-0.0286091,-0.0560072,-0.0269954,0.0479809,0.00733418,-0.0320044,0.0167937,-0.0125362,0.0287123,0.00230435,