21	note_1013	jfr	8	Isabel: How would you feel if the portfolio fell in a bad year?\nJane: I am very risk averse. A fall of more than 10% in a single year would make me very uncomfortable and would likely prompt me to sell.\n\nIsabel: On currencies?\nJane: Mainly SGD, with some USD.	[0.0579932,0.0350327,-0.203809,-0.00782272,0.0113888,0.0741186,0.0503615,-0.0500519,0.0935372,0.0143424,-0.0419665,0.0248012,0.0602468,0.0112714,0.0330561,0.0175206,-0.00665841,-0.0838851,0.0432015,0.086125,-0.0448629,-0.0604463,-0.078817,0.000731811,0.0153303,0.0334168,-0.0417292,-0.0181835,-0.00899448,0.0330781,-0.00325916,-0.0285793,-0.020734,-0.0560822,-0.002205,-0.0341251,0.0479177,0.046621,0.0264506,-0.0689057,0.0144181,-0.0302466,0.0602653,-0.0286129,0.072556,0.0354989,0.0710814,0.000686545,0.0807277,-0.0082224,0.0414821,0.0141319,0.0285103,0.00340624,0.0497486,0.0145372,-0.019742,0.043189,-0.00650303,-0.0152402,0.0578892,0.00135116,-0.00466303,0.00652852,0.0430467,-0.0339797,-0.0568051,0.0232327,-0.0264412,-0.0480326,0.0556862,0.00864984,0.0101291,0.0252122,-0.0747743,0.0256703,-0.0401624,-0.0377621,0.00136382,0.0310319,0.0103847,0.00126126,0.0521682,0.000302732,0.052795,0.0221206,0.0364598,0.0197076,-0.00895778,0.0979966,-0.00724782,0.020516,0.0519602,0.0550903,-0.0684437,0.0298147,-0.0599394,0.012677,-0.0313359,-0.0270384,-0.0211531,-0.0323448,0.04153,-0.00197107,0.0114617,0.0246695,0.0374221,-0.0284768,0.00923718,-0.017601,-0.044558,0.0426787,-0.0485007,-0.0304258,-0.000208213,-0.00704376,0.0370203,-0.0337111,0.00324425,0.0711616,-0.021718,0.0163476,0.0602775,0.0440558,0.0104798,0.0447333,-0.0145598,0.0326258,0.00545939,-0.0429269,-0.0212362,-0.0160403,-0.00286271,0.000488928,-0.0101275,0.0877882,-0.0222104,-0.0117224,-0.0347124,0.0429066,0.0753335,0.0112301,0.0122002,-0.0456311,-0.0449975,-0.0361992,0.0546921,0.029979,-0.0383575,0.00342839,-0.0152377,0.0361394,-0.0177312,0.0243888,0.0159268,-0.0702342,-0.00843941,-0.0210503,0.0232473,-0.024377,0.0496966,0.00696712,0.00647184,0