27	note_1020	jfr	2	Jane: When bond prices dropped in 2022 I kept my positions, but I worried about it daily and asked my previous adviser twice to move to cash. That is how I know my limit. Isabel: So your willingness to take risk is low. In terms of your ability, you have a long horizon, an income of S$10m that covers your costs, and a large asset base, so you could afford more risk than you want to take.	[0.0712142,0.0529481,-0.187962,-0.0073599,0.018288,0.0501747,0.0366739,-0.0337086,0.0780348,0.028159,-0.0573101,0.0183678,0.0189501,0.0028758,0.0544454,0.00629125,0.0024167,-0.0699722,0.0687011,0.0353938,-0.041014,-0.0700501,-0.0341852,0.00400195,-0.00977911,-0.0144916,-0.0322003,-0.00517094,-0.00766444,0.0198141,0.0296782,-0.0308618,0.0169007,-0.0789284,-0.00677932,-0.0615983,0.0492667,0.0373684,0.0342554,-0.0571274,0.023891,-0.0107404,0.0534311,-0.0465317,0.0622471,0.0164391,0.0482006,0.0174102,0.0964258,-0.00884395,0.0429527,0.00223527,-0.0317087,0.0239774,0.0821211,0.00898759,-0.0603919,0.0298774,-0.00820759,-0.0289956,0.111006,-0.00816302,0.0157898,0.04129,0.0347078,-0.0280928,-0.0726218,0.0338584,-0.0061598,-0.051419,0.0258178,-0.0175398,-0.0409146,-0.0146679,-0.0452174,0.0457005,-0.0100492,0.00252078,0.0360504,0.0231262,0.0170782,-0.0345263,0.0454814,0.0105081,0.0479041,0.0381443,0.0409711,0.00674134,0.0118016,0.0831696,0.0189081,0.018419,0.0617408,0.0603487,-0.0509111,0.0310047,-0.053643,0.0323585,0.0018131,-0.0366895,-0.0374462,-0.0326674,0.0120377,0.0138653,-0.00962631,0.00377851,-0.0120266,-0.0194522,0.00977021,0.0217991,-0.026112,0.0171907,-0.0401112,-0.0257749,-0.0267376,-0.0297297,0.0312122,-0.0191814,0.00901054,0.0387283,-0.0148981,0.0162095,0.0820856,0.043039,-0.00117169,0.0535905,-0.0185631,0.00845253,0.0499079,-0.00390634,-0.00152898,0.0048647,-0.0406158,0.00317807,-0.0100104,0.100651,-0.0420495,-0.0485272,-0.0052582,0.0420096,0.0588096,0.0280617,0.0335189,-0.0543305,-0.0679959,-0.030302,0.0344937,0.00970248,-0.0373748,-0.0122578,-0.0132886,0.014