31	note_1020	jfr	6	Isabel: And taxes?\nJane: I am a Singapore tax resident and I am in the top income tax bracket of 24% on my salary and bonus. There is no tax on capital gains here, so I do not need tax-loss harvesting and I do not want the portfolio traded just for tax reasons. I would rather have low turnover. Please keep interest and dividend income simple and tell me about any foreign withholding tax.	[0.0472701,0.0191304,-0.179437,-0.0039116,-0.0146514,0.038472,0.0405822,-0.0398215,0.0897623,-0.00868568,-0.0270093,0.00169191,0.0654111,-0.0313118,-4.69435e-05,0.00902393,-0.000745763,-0.0757993,0.0630732,0.0977879,-0.0665634,-0.0558167,-0.0499936,0.0202827,0.0468832,0.028338,0.0142461,-0.0341238,-0.0214826,-0.00616685,0.0011245,-0.00467436,0.00748539,-0.0241969,-0.0273534,0.00231844,0.0868718,0.0275567,-0.0163197,-0.0499595,0.0467037,-0.0419101,-0.015734,-0.04105,0.0394619,0.062271,0.132129,0.0216608,0.0431007,0.0055869,-0.0110274,-0.0227889,-0.0685933,0.0540239,0.0360483,0.0114673,-0.0573203,0.042929,0.00631412,-0.044045,0.0398326,0.026265,-0.0146936,0.062275,0.0177328,-0.0165359,0.00304094,0.0250046,-0.0137342,-0.0362644,0.0216451,-0.014794,0.0199392,0.00634233,-0.0313409,0.0256461,-0.037675,-0.0545719,-0.0105621,0.0366645,-0.000621878,-0.0236572,0.0600202,0.0232747,0.0370626,0.0166885,0.0215533,-0.00499172,0.0184537,0.0933743,0.0189659,0.0369327,0.0639893,0.0271547,-0.0677683,0.0098365,-0.0471758,0.00905231,0.00909851,-0.0218676,-0.0343389,-0.0263118,0.0565647,0.00528294,0.0496942,0.0266069,0.0289585,-0.0297964,-0.00145762,-0.0368582,-0.0203153,0.0300635,-0.016132,-0.0208809,-0.0447611,0.00276724,0.044471,-0.040747,0.0109513,0.0735287,-0.00537201,0.00191185,0.0562557,0.0707644,-0.00648485,0.107239,-0.0147898,0.0215706,0.0342162,-0.0366786,0.0192187,-0.0260147,-0.0205198,0.0195395,0.00337147,0.0701001,-0.049305,-0.0189361,0.0032692,0.0390509,0.0395014,0.0546478,0.0208771,-0.0130895,-0.0477808,-0.0107007,0.0918054,-0.0113324,-0.0397642,0.0231917,0.0294617,0.00