49	note_jft_1020	jft	1	Isabel: Last week you said a fall of more than 10% in a year would be hard for you. Does that still hold? Jane: Yes. I am very risk averse. A fall of more than 10% in a single year would make me very uncomfortable and would likely prompt me to sell. Isabel: Has that happened before?	[0.0595086,0.0411028,-0.20804,0.00431597,0.0164608,0.0563353,0.0611912,-0.0169414,0.0921175,0.0207689,-0.0434527,0.00145911,0.0351698,0.0119096,0.0284574,0.0331924,-0.00802752,-0.0895321,0.0469018,0.0560122,-0.036671,-0.0524961,-0.0818992,-0.00418403,-0.020812,0.0587018,-0.0530759,-0.0109307,-0.0142301,0.0519609,-0.0118462,-0.0309504,-0.0101206,-0.0688828,-0.0148506,-0.0368319,0.0265146,0.0307064,0.0462689,-0.0537907,0.0383612,-0.0210948,0.0342708,-0.0295787,0.0567879,0.00358114,0.0620189,0.00971757,0.0590906,0.00438592,0.052333,-0.0350454,0.00024283,0.00621398,0.043273,0.0173466,-0.0160045,0.0207545,0.0140029,-0.0159843,0.0688316,0.0107592,-0.0114265,0.0170775,0.0275183,-0.0365412,-0.0714801,0.0356673,-0.0243785,-0.0613518,0.045183,0.0099219,0.00239247,-0.00438399,-0.0611004,0.0278516,-0.0335808,-0.0285348,0.0102302,0.0279703,0.0222904,-0.000642181,0.0404797,0.00535371,0.0407552,0.0103228,0.0464712,0.0241422,-0.00693584,0.100902,0.0120207,0.0175003,0.062068,0.0736873,-0.0578503,-0.00801954,-0.0776573,0.0213791,-0.0309912,-0.0248438,-0.0222588,-0.0266226,0.0360959,0.00802419,-0.00219239,0.00953848,0.0320693,-0.0315767,0.0136669,-0.00783841,-0.051645,0.0532022,-0.0531807,-0.0449587,-0.0145374,0.00187615,0.0494687,-0.0234438,0.0223873,0.0498562,-0.00939492,0.00447652,0.0574218,0.0379364,-0.00280632,0.0333946,-0.00723287,0.0432813,0.0328255,-0.0440037,-0.0298809,-0.00698398,0.00514967,0.00976142,0.0010267,0.0833507,-0.0346305,-0.00294314,-0.0180934,0.0397908,0.0820703,0.0470349,0.0209548,-0.0291131,-0.0401715,-0.0447334,0.0334804,0.0277685,-0.0459773,-0.00181806,-0.0164001,0.017309,-0.00397178,0.0192519,0.00511794,-0.0515146,-0.0272449,0.0118671,0.0174735,-0.0118509,0