55	note_jft_1020	jft	7	Isabel: Is there a view on equities now? Jane: I am now open to adding up to 15% in blue-chip equities, up from the 10% discussed at the first meeting, as the modest growth part of my assets. I prefer the rest to stay in cash, government bonds and high-grade bonds. Isabel: And the sustainable investing point? Jane: Please apply it as a rule, not just a nice-to-have.	[0.0242899,0.0859148,-0.167881,-0.0136478,0.0473984,0.0459677,0.0538809,-0.046048,0.0480256,0.0363339,-0.00650839,0.0270201,0.048584,0.0547272,0.0272479,-0.00519243,-0.0127318,-0.0949337,0.0545954,0.0835492,-0.0645993,-0.0588384,-0.0361128,-0.00435011,0.0259264,0.0277687,-0.023502,0.0010049,-0.00395673,0.00756325,0.00795943,-0.0350587,0.0427281,-0.0382235,-0.00354428,-0.0260481,0.0466885,0.062972,-0.0221851,-0.0694363,0.0483441,0.011555,0.00725108,-0.0864637,0.0512179,0.0322727,0.0950348,-0.0231652,0.0710272,-0.00856825,0.0254895,0.0257043,0.00361435,-0.0101462,0.076648,0.0243371,-0.0234076,0.0655925,0.0235846,-0.00662856,0.088394,-0.0217702,0.0203787,0.0413317,0.0420607,0.00125674,-0.0605968,0.0359837,-0.0231926,-0.0384684,0.0219636,0.0181025,0.00820474,0.0179367,-0.0501394,0.00438893,-0.0219403,-0.00243706,-0.0127776,0.0186277,0.0247358,-0.0215976,0.0597924,-0.0208841,0.00963728,0.0176915,0.0347204,0.0082451,0.0245666,0.0926263,0.0162349,0.0352501,0.0803916,0.0681063,-0.0688087,-0.0129594,-0.0349985,0.00279313,-0.0340006,-0.0240755,-0.0310213,-0.0428211,0.0316206,0.0324081,0.00932763,0.0651665,0.002967,-0.0101636,7.05352e-05,-0.010196,-0.0301278,0.0127423,-0.0273805,-0.0188111,-0.0514425,0.0042147,0.0319691,-0.0365629,0.00043036,0.0892319,-0.0036841,0.00506157,0.0678792,0.00989454,-0.00226966,0.0378653,-0.043498,0.0145618,0.0114371,-0.0188636,-0.00470275,-0.000453412,-0.00315867,-0.0180555,0.0118415,0.0928502,-0.0215259,-0.0240999,0.00164252,0.0427927,0.042791,0.00916241,0.0104852,-0.0156816,-0.0449864,-0.0557175,0.0549668,0.0224725,-0.0149543,0.0359469,-0.0374672,0.0255037,0.008