72	note_jft_1013	jft	1	Isabel: Thank you for coming in, Jane. Let's start with you. Could you tell me about your background and how you earn your income? Jane: I am the Chief Executive Officer of CityBank. I was born on 14 March 1981, so I am 45 now. My pay is a salary plus a performance bonus, and together that comes to an annual income of S$10m.	[0.00656799,0.0381828,-0.170892,0.00903245,-0.0419213,0.0774407,0.0662314,-0.0188489,0.0556256,0.0170617,-0.0876237,0.00696405,0.0588297,-0.0233606,0.0629644,-0.0169912,-0.0135506,-0.0892138,0.0313271,0.0552288,-0.0371614,-0.0425217,-0.0466729,0.000257223,0.0790991,-0.00129047,-0.0406681,-0.00784781,0.00730377,-0.0148162,-0.00206459,0.0223876,0.022428,-0.0388101,0.0149887,-0.0214631,0.0467486,0.012172,0.00993286,-0.0517629,0.0473029,-0.0289005,-0.0139499,-0.0584195,0.0197982,0.00153494,0.0440923,-0.013227,0.0616226,-0.0143909,-0.0442987,0.0125216,0.00575719,0.0730489,0.0366987,0.026699,-0.0267968,0.0480392,0.0310046,-0.0524288,0.0962184,0.0720773,0.0450861,0.0610241,0.039162,-0.0195604,-0.0217104,0.0808095,-0.0335257,-0.0148034,-0.00613047,-0.0435004,-0.0339122,0.0416317,0.000755592,0.0169336,-0.0229513,-0.0134459,0.0406426,0.0289056,0.0351165,0.0112652,0.0144006,0.0120291,-0.0020429,0.000249518,-0.0301102,-0.0180246,-0.00424454,0.0514294,0.0205031,0.0856164,0.0655494,0.0798859,-0.0384457,0.0162588,-0.00811079,-0.00671226,-0.00186441,0.00495979,-0.0447201,-0.032261,0.0385812,0.0319741,0.0360162,0.0406825,0.010107,-0.0419842,-0.00582132,-0.0233111,-0.00069868,0.0165801,-0.010308,-0.00653841,-0.0519404,0.0245881,0.0332191,-0.0240275,-0.0106052,0.0975492,-0.0196803,0.000269675,0.0741089,-0.00589113,-0.0159724,0.0613129,-0.0167061,0.0242155,0.0225214,-0.00320378,0.0188931,-0.00410072,0.0163132,0.00458649,-0.00961403,0.0845509,-0.0225222,-0.0351345,0.0197236,0.00734354,0.0551583,0.029653,0.0425873,-0.0447323,-0.0437163,-0.0314466,0.0464319,-0.011969,-0.0252524,0.0723562,-0.0073996,0.0308135,0.00407426,0.0318877,0.0210193,-0.051