77	note_jft_1013	jft	6	Isabel: What do you want the portfolio to achieve? Jane: Keeping my capital safe comes first and steady income is second. After that I would like my assets to grow, but only modestly and without an aggressive approach. I want low risk, but steady growth. My target is for the portfolio to reach 700M within 8 years.	[0.0505388,0.0466837,-0.174047,0.00846656,-0.00180649,0.0273252,0.0799331,-0.0543093,0.0657702,-0.00188713,-0.0401619,0.0160585,0.0595263,-0.00769408,0.0477239,0.0171268,0.00362384,-0.097142,0.0570195,0.0441152,-0.0610501,-0.0571594,-0.0384968,0.0104435,0.0213366,0.0512255,-0.0156828,-0.0120178,0.000813639,0.0284209,0.0265886,0.00427551,-0.0121809,-0.0248276,0.000350593,-0.0668136,0.0278737,0.0588101,0.0176568,-0.094076,0.03676,-0.0101101,0.0373124,-0.0563439,0.0511646,0.0017157,0.0652909,-0.0389359,0.0856864,-0.027695,0.0422793,0.020708,0.0073233,0.0219755,0.0770532,0.0189191,-0.0321745,0.0212156,0.00688092,-0.0575618,0.101953,0.0051573,-0.0233515,0.0531974,0.0291986,-0.0488595,-0.0544553,-0.00526007,-0.0213678,-0.027057,0.00550988,-0.0200945,-0.00590784,0.00383096,-0.0516969,0.00991445,0.000741876,-0.0124384,0.035899,0.0115767,0.0321816,0.00430634,0.0439749,-0.0169437,0.0160453,0.0310733,0.0130071,-0.0143339,0.00753363,0.0689573,0.0198708,0.0380436,0.0324266,0.0569142,-0.0612624,0.0313686,-0.0448495,0.0427306,-0.0203531,-0.0290676,-0.0198519,-0.0375819,0.0430872,0.0167498,0.0114081,0.0258533,0.0255353,-0.00823731,0.00121293,-0.0138399,-0.0305942,0.00855055,-0.0299145,-0.0447677,-0.0558214,-0.0132085,0.0727734,0.0047893,0.0384473,0.0739596,-0.0280848,0.010611,0.0723114,0.025848,0.0118637,0.0362553,-0.034769,0.0248373,0.0228644,-0.00682838,0.0182155,0.0113816,-0.0261748,0.0178823,0.0206857,0.0964668,-0.0301324,-0.0263867,-0.0039503,0.0517854,0.0616649,0.0207282,0.0288106,-0.0540015,-0.0668927,-0.0517705,0.0515368,0.0240939,-0.0056486,0.0374683,-0.0202693,0.0280443,-0.027799,0.0139512,0.032076,-0.0533331,0.000802091,-0.0176864,0.04475