78	note_jft_1013	jft	7	I would not need to touch most of the capital for at least ten years, so I am a long-term investor. Isabel: So I will record your investment period as ten years or longer, with the 700M target to be reached within 8 years. Jane: Yes, my investment period is at least ten years. Isabel: From S$500m to 700M is about 40% in total, or roughly 4.3% a year if it compounds.	[0.0619951,0.0899267,-0.179355,0.00176407,-0.0174887,0.0150715,0.0408981,-0.0163277,0.0735346,0.022418,-0.0514415,0.0100239,0.0220062,-0.0240001,0.031286,-0.0365148,0.0131007,-0.0787462,0.0375658,0.0809096,-0.0323428,-0.0513617,-0.0860823,-0.0242054,-0.00690805,0.0236282,-0.0214236,0.00138218,0.00912445,0.0216626,0.0499705,-0.025682,0.00975962,-0.0209718,-0.0178201,-0.0985476,0.0185037,0.0207971,0.0178859,-0.0809822,0.0540094,-0.0120895,0.0636155,-0.00293602,0.0560877,0.0166021,0.0455114,-0.0415941,0.0671842,-0.0128346,0.0118177,0.0314671,-0.0202781,0.0384989,0.0514176,0.0365283,-0.0616909,0.0185753,0.00502906,-0.0425701,0.109058,-0.017633,-0.0226903,0.0728835,0.0362299,-0.0279956,-0.0570729,0.018989,-0.00684971,-0.0470002,0.0340443,0.00862608,-0.0312676,0.0181791,-0.0267841,0.0312103,-0.0327199,0.00909424,0.0393757,0.0463682,0.0524695,-0.0171678,0.0405099,-0.0366117,0.0497617,0.0204974,0.0247201,-0.00828005,0.000320789,0.0897578,0.00623583,0.0406163,0.0444433,0.0797638,-0.0406458,0.00427952,-0.0364845,0.049019,-0.0292169,0.0146365,-0.0323603,-0.0207081,0.0153443,0.04773,0.0199967,0.0588898,0.00420326,-0.0642512,-0.00272761,-0.0429012,-0.0684159,0.00680121,-0.0267382,-0.0115527,-0.0535963,0.000770281,0.0439533,0.00641621,0.016678,0.0593107,-0.0303429,0.0140959,0.0659803,0.0335152,-0.00924926,0.0243223,-0.0201731,0.0513808,0.0195466,-0.00695001,-0.00250875,0.0234278,-0.0140225,-0.00680902,0.0189305,0.0931913,0.00798259,-0.0476596,-0.0254778,0.0636947,0.0467748,0.00329379,0.0419445,-0.0599559,-0.0468515,-0.0355982,0.032718,0.00441686,-0.0267091,0.0486053,-0.0257331,0.0334152,-0.02283